n><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7352caca1960999c\" href=\"?note=7352caca1960999c\" title=\"88-df-model\">88-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"dba31c144607e57b\" href=\"?note=dba31c144607e57b\" title=\"88-df-countable\">88-df-countable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" href=\"?note=4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" title=\"88-thm-lowenheim-skolem\">88-thm-lowenheim-skolem</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是候选签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"da378af7f2f57e43\" href=\"?note=da378af7f2f57e43\" title=\"88-df-signature-size\">88-df-signature-size</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sentence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sentence}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>。语法可数性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"c03ee71a93771472\" href=\"?note=c03ee71a93771472\" title=\"88-lem-countable-syntax\">88-lem-countable-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 是候选句子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_S(\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_S(\\Phi)\\)</span> 与集合满足记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"7352caca1960999c\" href=\"?note=7352caca1960999c\" title=\"88-df-model\">88-df-model</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>；单句满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"dba31c144607e57b\" href=\"?note=dba31c144607e57b\" title=\"88-df-countable\">88-df-countable</a>；存在性使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" href=\"?note=4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" title=\"88-thm-lowenheim-skolem\">88-thm-lowenheim-skolem</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}loewenheim\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\forall S,\\Phi\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\n\\land\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\n(\\mathrm{Sentence}_S(\\varphi)\\land\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}loewenheim\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\forall S,\\Phi\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\n\\land\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Phi)\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\n(\\mathrm{Sentence}_S(\\varphi)\\land\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由向下 Löwenheim–Skolem 定理的可数模型形式，取得实际论域至多可数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构。句子集的类型条件使集合满足关系恰为逐句满足，展开后得到显示的结论。</p>\n<p>修正的不是单纯缺少几个链接：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是签名元组，旧前件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}(S)\\)</span> 并不限制非逻辑符号数；旧结论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}(|\\mathfrak B|)\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}(|\\mathfrak B|)\\)</span> 也混淆了结构编码、论域和基数。现在使用真实的签名可数性，并直接检查 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)\\)</span>。句子、公式、自由变量、结构、单句满足、模型与可满足性均有直接定义引用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-signature-size","status":"resolved","id":"da378af7f2f57e43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-signature-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-countable-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"c03ee71a93771472","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-lem-countable-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df